cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WAMCES for tellegen"
message: >-
  This repository converts two open datasets. If you use the case, please cite the
  article under preferred-citation and the records under references.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kohlhaas
    given-names: Stephan
    email: stephan.kohlhaas@tum.de
    affiliation: "Technical University of Munich"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/stkotum/wamces-tellegen"
abstract: >-
  A converter that builds a MATPOWER case of the continental European transmission
  grid for tellegen. It joins the PanTaGruEl network with the WAMCES AC operating
  point. The case has 3809 buses with coordinates. tellegen reproduces the stored
  WAMCES power flow from a flat start to 1e-13.
keywords:
  - power systems
  - power flow
  - optimal power flow
  - test case
  - continental Europe

